    <item>
      <title>Outbound v1.4</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 17:39:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>The painting now stays on the lock screen and the login window, and quitting puts your own picture back on every desktop. Outbound uses about half the memory, starts sooner after an update, and moves between desktops without a jump. New installs start without the painted border.</p>]]></description>
