    <item>
      <title>Outbound v1.3</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 23:43:08 +0000</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>A new look: real trees and shadows, rivers that bend, cars that keep to the road with soft low beams, and a redrawn Lapland, La Pampa and Niigata. Outbound now speaks your Mac's language, the painted border can be turned off from the menu bar, it can stay over one place, and no light flickers any more.</p>]]></description>
      <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
