    <item>
      <title>Outbound v1.1</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 11:00:23 +0000</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Smoother on every display: frames reach the screen at an even 30 a second, the bird keeps up with the cursor, and Fly To no longer stutters. Pasting a license key works, and Outbound now runs on macOS 13 Ventura and later.</p>]]></description>
